# Web3Forms Access Key for Contact Form Submissions
# To receive form submissions in your email:
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your email address (e.g. info@solidbusrental.com) and click "Create Access Key"
# 3. Paste the key you receive below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=YOUR_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY
